dest step up. This keeps us cautious while testing a more balanced baseline.\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\nA small upward nudge keeps us cautious while testing whether this modest improvement is acceptable to the group.\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nWe're drifting into indecisive territory\u2014moving from -7 to -6 to -5 suggests we're gravitating toward timidity when we should commit to a meaningful position. I propose <VALUE>-7</VALUE> to restore a more substantive baseline.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nCritic C makes a compelling point\u2014we risk losing decisiveness by drifting incrementally upward without clear justification. I support <VALUE>-7</VALUE> as a substantive baseline that balances prudent caution with collaborative stability.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nDelegate D's support confirms that -7 represents a substantive commitment worth testing as our baseline. I maintain <VALUE>-7</VALUE> to see if this represents genuine group consensus or if others have compelling reasons to adjust.\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nWith Critic C's continued endorsement, -7 represents a prudent baseline that respects caution while allowing space for reasoned adjustment if Builder B or Analyst A present compelling collaborative grounds. I maintain <VALUE>-7</VALUE> to test whether this achieves stable consensus.\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nA small upward nudge maintains caution while testing whether a modest improvement can still feel stable for everyone. <VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nA modest step helps test a more balanced, stable baseline without overcommitting. <VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nA one-step nudge upward tests stability without overreach and keeps us grounded. <VALUE>-4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nA careful two-step nudge builds on recent upward movement while still testing stability without overreach.\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nThe rapid climb from -7 to -2 warrants a more cautious reconsideration; prudence suggests testing whether -4 can anchor a stable middle ground that respects both caution and collaboration. <VALUE>-4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}, {"answer": "\nDelegate D's caution about the rapid climb from -7 to -2 deserves weight; testing -6 respects that prudence while establishing a more decisive baseline than recent wobbling suggests. <VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "0a8f2d6e-1bd8-41c5-80f8-4c257111c3ea"}]}